# Restricted Stripe key for hosted Checkout (rk_ / rkcs_ / sk_test_).
# Server-only: Cloudflare `wrangler secret put STRIPE_SECRET_KEY`, or the same
# name in Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables if you still use Hobby.
# Never prefix with VITE_ — that would expose the secret to the browser.
# Checkout still works without a key (local confirmation fallback).
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
